OL,3,GNEWSAWork to cut sewage spills nears
OL,4,Acompletion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA giant underground tank designed to
OL,7,Fcut sewage spills into a local
OL,8,Fwatercourse is taking shape as a major
OL,9,Finfrastructure project reaches a key
OL,10,Fmilestone.
OL,12,FYorkshire Water said work beneath the
OL,13,FBrushes allotment site on Vickers Road
OL,14,Fin Sheffield, was about two-thirds
OL,15,Ffinished and remained on track for
OL,16,Fcompletion in summer 2027.
OL,18,FThe #3.2m scheme sparked concern in
OL,19,FJanuary when a community charity feared
OL,20,Fit could struggle to survive after
OL,21,Fbeing forced to leave the site while
OL,22,Fconstruction took place.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
